   "text": "University of New York in Prague - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of New York in Prague\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of New York in Prague offers a genuine American university experience in the heart of Europe. Accredited Bachelor's, Master's, MBA, and PhD programs are taught in English in an officially recognized higher education institution in the Czech Republic, and in partnership with prestigious international universities in the United States and Europe.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 12:02\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 12:02\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCzech Republic\nYearly Fees\nMax: €11,407.03\nMin: €9,774.02\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n68%\n679 of 999 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1998\nCampus(es)\nPrague\nCountry\nCzech Republic\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n16/10/2020\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nSeveral accommodations in Prague could be options for freshmen students.\nScholarship Offered\nUNYP Merit Scholarships are available for international students.\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XqDW1gHSO_g\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
